  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Nothing drawn for «اقتلوا أنفسكم أو اخرجوا من دياركم» (no violence, no homes left). Growth for «خيرا لهم», a mountain for «وأشد تثبيتا», light for the reward, footsteps for «صراطا مستقيما». The tafsirs differ on whom 66 addresses (Al-Muyassar: the hypocrites; As-Sa'di: all servants), so no gloss names them. Al-Muyassar's first-person «لأعطيناهم/لأرشدناهم» not used. STAGING v4: 66-68 stay ambient: 66 is a counterfactual about a command to kill themselves or leave their homes (killing; the tafsirs differ on whom it addresses), and 67-68 are the counterfactual reward and guidance from Him; showing people doing or receiving it would present it as having happened."
